    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Gideon Reeling Immersive Experience Producers",
            "paragraphs": [
                "The Soho Shuffle will be a part of The West End Open House Festival Neighbourhood,  'Maybe It's because I'm a Londoner!' celebration, officially opened by the Lord Mayor of Westminster.",
                "2pm: Launch of the Soho Shuffle",
                "Maps, directions and information in Soho Square and at participating venues.",
                "Gideon Reeling, have been making immersive experiences for 20 years, in London, nationally and internationally.\n \nThe Soho Shuffle blends digital technologies with world-class immersive performance in this  joyous collaboration between the  Museum of Soho, combining the museum’s unparalleled local knowledge and unique access with Gideon Reeling’s experience as site-responsive theatre makers, to open a door to both a thrilling past and a vibrant present.",
                "'Maybe It's because I'm a Londoner!' is a programme of music, dance and performance from the different communities that have come and left their mark on the West End, running 12pm- 3pm.",
                "Look out for our 1940s Salvage Wardens who can guide you on your way."
            ]
        }
